1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,725
But a magnet inside a hot motor also needs a little of two heavier ones — dysprosium and terbium — to keep its strength in the heat.

2
00:00:08,725 --> 00:00:13,122
Our own atomic energy department says India has very little of those.

3
00:00:13,122 --> 00:00:15,620
For now, we depend on others for them.

4
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:18,721
So the sand alone was never going to be enough.

5
00:00:18,721 --> 00:00:20,456
You need the whole chain.

6
00:00:20,456 --> 00:00:22,590
And then came the wake-up call.

7
00:00:22,590 --> 00:00:24,540
April, twenty twenty-five.

8
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:31,534
China said companies now need special permission to send out seven rare earths... and the magnets made with them.

9
00:00:31,534 --> 00:00:33,026
Permission takes time.

10
00:00:33,026 --> 00:00:35,686
And while you wait, your supply dries up.

11
00:00:35,686 --> 00:00:38,230
You saw what that did to Bajaj by July.

12
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:40,687
Ather and T.V.S. felt the pressure too.

13
00:00:40,687 --> 00:00:49,543
Back in April, Rajiv Bajaj had warned — if China stopped these magnets, India's whole electric vehicle industry could halt within weeks.

14
00:00:49,543 --> 00:00:53,403
Later, China started giving permission to some Indian companies.

15
00:00:53,403 --> 00:00:54,745
But there was a condition.

16
00:00:54,745 --> 00:00:57,470
You couldn't use those magnets for defence.

17
00:00:57,470 --> 00:01:02,046
Then in October twenty twenty-five, China announced even tougher rules.

18
00:01:02,046 --> 00:01:05,740
But after talks with America, it paused them — for one year.

19
00:01:05,740 --> 00:01:09,179
That pause ends on November tenth, twenty twenty-six.

20
00:01:09,179 --> 00:01:13,570
America and China have already stretched their own trade deal till January.

21
00:01:13,570 --> 00:01:15,096
So here's what you watch.

22
00:01:15,096 --> 00:01:18,711
Will China stretch this pause too... or let it end?

23
00:01:18,711 --> 00:01:20,396
And the April permission rule?

24
00:01:20,396 --> 00:01:21,633
It never went away.

